otstrap intervals.\n- **Weekend peak:** it is a single midday peak around 15:00.\n\nThe agent is not overstating, and the seasonal framing will need to say \"broad summer–autumn plateau, trough in Jan–Feb\". I haven't looked at the figures yet.\n\nVERDICT {\"outcome\": \"continue\", \"reason\": \"Analysis outputs are rigorous: bootstrap CIs, peak-month instability disclosed, YoY growth confound tracked, sensitivity to holidays/DST. Figures still to be inspected.\", \"suggestion\": \"\"}","ttft_ms":2535,"type":"result","duration_ms":8632,"uuid":"1bb952fd-edf0-48f3-977b-7c3c6aa667fc","ttft_stream_ms":2535,"time_to_request_ms":19,"first_content_frame_ms":2535,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":64}
