{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_011CgAwMefdgoj4gtdNjjrKm","type":"message","role":"assistant","container":null,"content":[{"type":"text","text":"The rerun completed cleanly. The sample size is now 1,000,000 per group, and the sampled medians match the full-population medians to within 0.02 minutes. The casual-to-member median duration ratio is about 1.57–1.62. The paired within-week estimates show a weekday pattern that shifts between years: in 2023 Wednesday is highest and Monday low, while in 2024 weekdays are flatter and Friday is highest. Weekends are lowest in both years (Sunday about 0.85–0.88 of the week mean). The report should say the weekday ordering is not stable across years.\n\nVERDICT {\"outcome\": \"continue\", \"reason\": \"Rerun fixed sample sizes; sampled medians match full-population values; paired DOW results added with CIs and the cross-year instability visible for the report.\", \"suggestion\": \"\"}","citations":[]}],"model":"anthropic/claude-sonnet-5.5","stop_reason":null,"stop_details":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":3,"output_tokens_details":null,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1844,"cache_read_input_tokens":165036,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1844,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","server_tool_use":null,"service_tier":"standard","speed":"standard"},"provider":"Claude Platform on AWS","context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f28cb260-bf06-4460-a876-8d1d595fdf43","uuid":"7c1b4e88-23b1-49e1-a041-c894aaab27ec","timestamp":"2026-10-19T04:08:06.040Z","request_id":"gen-1792382881-cLPqS2aKl0S4n6SoqxnJ"}
